  (text "Ring L/N/E land on the busbar; only outlet current passes the shunts and relays.\nShunt common end = L_BUS = hot-side ground. Net ties NT1-NT4 force the IP/IN taps to start at the shunt pads (Kelvin).\nThermal cut-offs: non-resettable, clamped to the outlet feed near the contacts; Tf chosen after the EVT thermal test." (at 21.5900 40.6400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid d72a8603-d19f-4ad2-a585-5518d0127d88))
