  (rectangle (start 20.32 207.01) (end 149.86 283.21) (stroke (width 0.35) (type default)) (fill (type color) (color 214 92 64 0.10)) (uuid 77e8c282-49fd-4c62-8d53-344b7e80f271))
  (text "3. HOT-SIDE 3.3 V SUPPLY (KP3310SGA)" (at 21.5900 208.2800 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid c2af5a3c-7967-4090-95a9-fbf47bf5ab2b))
  (text "Half-wave from N_F; KP3310 charges VDD (7.8 V) while the line is low, then an LDO makes 3.3 V. SEL open = 3.3 V.\nD7 clamps the drain below its 650 V rating in a surge; R2 limits the clamp current (value from the R1 simulation).\nHold-up: 15 mA (worst case) x 20 ms / 220 uF = 1.4 V droop on VDD (7.8 V to 6.4 V), so VOUT stays in regulation." (at 21.5900 212.0900 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid a487e5c9-40fa-4b0b-85a9-a14ceba166d1))
