  (text "6. DIGITAL ISOLATOR (ISO7761DWR), STRADDLES THE 8 MM BARRIER" (at 378.4600 36.8300 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid bc2d06fd-0c43-497f-adb8-4a410ee67e44))
  (text "Side 1 (hot): BL0939 TX, zero-cross, polarity A/B, alarm in; BL0939 RX out. Side 2 (safe): firmware nets.\nRouted slot under the package. Outputs default high if the other side is unpowered: firmware reads POL_x only while the\nmeter is alive." (at 378.4600 40.6400 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 99378507-0fdf-44ef-860d-960427b0fd9c))
